## How to Engage

To discuss commercial licensing or partnerships, please provide:

1. A brief description of your intended use
2. Whether the use is internal, customer-facing, or both
3. Whether the application is automated, assisted, or advisory
4. The organizational context (company, practice, institution, government)
5. Any anticipated scale or deployment timeline

